    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίμμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>water for washing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίμματα ἐπέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dromo
					2
				</span></i>
			, censured by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				170
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίμματα προσώπου</span>”
				<i>cosmetics,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crito
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.448
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νίμμα προσώπου</span>
			<i>washing</i> of the face, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				82
			</span></i>.</div>
